h1: 'Check any car by *VIN or Ukrainian plate* before you buy',
sub: 'National Police wanted list, Ukrainian registration history, safety recalls and crash tests. Real open databases — results in seconds.',
q_ph: 'VIN or plate number', btn_check: 'Check',
vin_len: 'A VIN must be 17 characters; a plate looks like AA1234BB', vin_chars: 'VINs never contain I, O or Q — check for 1 / 0 mix-ups', vin_sum: 'The check digit does not match — one character is probably wrong. Re-read the VIN on the car or its documents.', vin_ok: 'VIN looks valid', plate_ok: 'Looks like a plate number',
trust1: 'Police wanted list — daily', trust2: 'MIA registry: VINs & plates', trust3: 'NHTSA data (US)', trust4: 'No sign-up',
feat_h: 'What we check',
feats: [['Wanted list','VIN or plate matched against the stolen-vehicle database of the National Police of Ukraine (updated daily).'],['Ukrainian registration history','Imports, owner changes, plate replacements, deregistration, export — from the open registry of the Ministry of Internal Affairs.'],['VIN decoder','Make, model, year, engine, transmission, plant — from NHTSA.'],['Recalls & complaints','Official safety recalls, owner complaints (crashes, fires) and NHTSA crash-test ratings.'],['VIN vs registry cross-check','If make or year from the VIN contradicts the registry record, the VIN plate may have been swapped.'],['Risk Score 0–100','An explainable verdict: what raises the risk and what to inspect.']],
how_h: 'How it works', steps: [['Enter VIN or plate','The VIN is on the windshield and registration. Plates are supported too.'],['Instant result','Wanted status, Ukrainian history, decoder, recalls and Risk Score.'],['Save the report','A permanent link to send to the seller or mechanic, plus print to PDF.']],
know_h: 'What makes us different', know: [['Source and date on everything','Each section says where the data comes from, which period it covers and when it was updated. No black boxes.'],['Typo shield','We verify the VIN check digit before any lookup — no wasted requests on a mistyped VIN.'],['Registry cross-check','We compare the VIN decode with the MIA registry and flag make/year mismatches.'],['Honest coverage','We show which registry period is indexed. If nothing is found we say why that can happen.']],
soon_h: 'Coming soon: US auctions & odometer', soon_p: 'Copart and IAAI lot history, photos, repair estimates, odometer readings and titles need a licensed data provider. Leave your email and we\'ll tell you when it goes live.', soon_ph: 'Your email', soon_btn: 'Notify me', soon_ok: 'Thanks! We\'ll let you know.',
src_h: 'Data sources', src_p: 'All data comes from official open sources. We do not sell owners\' personal data — the open registry doesn\'t contain any.',
srcs: [['National Police of Ukraine — wanted vehicles','data.gov.ua, updated daily','https://data.gov.ua/dataset/2cd12755-834b-4c43-9026-fe356ce93af5'],['Ministry of Internal Affairs — vehicle registry (VIN)','data.gov.ua, open data','https://data.gov.ua/dataset/348dbb24-a545-4d8c-95d5-18d35c593ca1'],['NHTSA (US) — VIN, recalls, complaints, crash tests','vpic.nhtsa.dot.gov, api.nhtsa.gov','https://www.nhtsa.gov/nhtsa-datasets-and-apis']],
launch_h: 'Launch offer: full report is free', launch_p: 'While we expand our databases, every report is free with no sign-up. Paid plans will arrive together with US auction data.',
faq_h: 'FAQ', faq: [['Is it free?','Right now yes: checks and full reports are free. Paid plans will come with extended data (US auctions, mileage).'],['Where does the data come from?','Open government datasets: National Police (wanted), MIA (vehicle registry), NHTSA (US). Sources and update dates are shown in every report.'],['Can I search by plate?','Yes. We look the plate up in the MIA registry (plate operations of recent years) and the wanted list. A VIN gives a fuller picture.'],['Why were no records found?','The car may have had no registry operations in the indexed period, come from abroad, or be new. No record is not proof of a clean history — inspect the car and check documents.'],['Do you have US auction data?','Not yet — that needs a licensed provider. Leave your email and we\'ll notify you.'],['What about personal data?','The open registry has no owner names. We collect only the VIN, an optional email and request history.']],
